      "text": "With the assistant: every entry drafted and approved within a day; Treasury's\n6.5% shows the 0.5% would cost Rs.55,535 more than it saves, so Vikram\ndeclines; 4471 is paid on 20th Nov after GSTR-2B confirms Rs.42,46,300.80 of\ncredit; reverse charge and TDS paid on time, each confirmed by the bank",
