      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[Agent] 5th Oct: enter_invoice drafts\nVoltway's invoice 4471 from the PDF:\n18,000 × Rs.1,332.80 = Rs.2,39,90,400. Two\nsuppliers sent a 4471, so it confirms the\nsupplier first; it checks the e-invoice\nIRN and the e-way bill. → approval loop:\nPriya approves it the same day",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "a_n5",
      "originalText": "[Agent] 5th Oct: enter_invoice drafts Voltway's invoice 4471 from the PDF: 18,000 × Rs.1,332.80 = Rs.2,39,90,400. Two suppliers sent a 4471, so it confirms the supplier first; it checks the e-invoice IRN and the e-way bill. → approval loop: Priya approves it the same day",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
