      "text": "[System] 6th Oct: Ledgerline posts the\ninvoice: the supplier is credited; the GST\nwaits as credit pending GSTR-2B, and the\nbroken packs' Rs.71,971.20 is reversed at\nonce (blocked, s.17(5)(h)). → approval\nloop: Meera approves",
