      "originalText": "[System] 6th Oct: Ledgerline posts the invoice: the supplier is credited; the GST waits as credit pending GSTR-2B, and the broken packs' Rs.71,971.20 is reversed at once (blocked, s.17(5)(h)). → approval loop: Meera approves",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
