      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[Human] 7th-8th Oct: Voltway emails better\nterms and calls Emma. The agent tells Emma\nwhat she may say (\"Accounts will look at\nit\") and drafts the new terms into the\nsupplier-offer table. → approval loop:\nPriya approves",
