      "text": "[Agent] 8th Oct, daily check: 4471 is\nclear to pay. The 0.5% needs the 16th Oct\nrun, 35 days before the normal 20th Nov\nrun (the 0.25%: the 30th Oct run, 21\ndays). It emails Treasury, an internal\naddress, for the rate on money kept until\n20th Nov",
